5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I want to make sure we don't promise something we can't sustain. I'll look into the county grant terms and the endowment, and the winter road closures north of the river.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about accessibility. I will check the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see what we did before! I'll check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops and those two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach requires financial clarity. I shall examine the running and equipment lines last year and the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We must consider our capacity. I will look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
