50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are a Mobile Branch, a Maker Workshop, Language Circles, or a Digital Archive. I fear the Mobile Branch due to the roads.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,The Mobile Branch is the only one that solves the bus link crisis. The others keep the service centralized.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Rin,,The Digital Archive is like the old project that failed! Let's do the Language Circles or the Mobile Branch!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The Mobile Branch is a financial trap given the running costs. The Language Circles seem the most stable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Minako,,The Maker Workshop is risky because our tool certification expert retired. Language Circles are the safest for staff.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The Language Circles seem gentle and sustainable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, is there no way to supervise a mobile service?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I like the idea of the Mobile Branch, but if Benjamin says it's too expensive, maybe the Circles?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, the cost is the issue, not just the supervision. The budget would thin out too quickly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Minako,,I cannot support the Workshop or the Archive. The Circles are the most viable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel we have found a consensus that respects our limits.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am disappointed for the outer wards, but I see the logic.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! Something new that actually stays!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,It is the most rational choice for the long term.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Minako,,I agree. It is the most manageable.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us vote then.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am ready.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Rin,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Minako,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
